@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram for Ott Based System Mini Reel

state Start
state LoggedOut
state AccountCreation
state IncorrectDetails
state SignIn
state LoginAttemptInvalid
state UserProfileManagement
state WatchVideos
state UploadVideo
state SaveVideo
state ViewSavedVideos
state EnterDiscussion
state BlogsNewsUpdates
state ProvideFeedback
state PublishedArticles
state SearchArticles
state ReadArticle
state NewCase
state CaseCategorySelection
state CaseDetailsEntry
state SetReminder
state UploadDocuments
state AccountCreation_Admin
state ArticleReview
state ArticleApproval
state ArticleRejection

Start --> LoggedOut: Login/SignUp
LoggedOut --> AccountCreation: New Account
AccountCreation --> IncorrectDetails: Incorrect Details
IncorrectDetails --> AccountCreation: Retry
AccountCreation --> AccountCreation_Admin: Admin Account
AccountCreation_Admin --> UserProfileManagement: Successful Registration
UserProfileManagement --> ArticleReview: Review Articles
ArticleReview --> ArticleApproval: Approve Article
ArticleReview --> ArticleRejection: Reject Article
SignIn --> WatchVideos: Successful Login
WatchVideos --> UploadVideo: Upload Video
UploadVideo --> SaveVideo: Save to Likes List
SaveVideo --> ViewSavedVideos: View Saved Videos
ViewSavedVideos --> EnterDiscussion: Enter Discussion Option
EnterDiscussion --> WatchVideos: Continue Watching
WatchVideos --> NewCase: Add a New Case
NewCase --> CaseCategorySelection: Select Category
CaseCategorySelection --> CaseDetailsEntry: Enter Details
CaseDetailsEntry --> SetReminder: Set Reminders
SetReminder --> UploadDocuments: Upload Related Documents
UploadDocuments --> WatchVideos: Continue Watching
BlogsNewsUpdates --> ProvideFeedback: Give Feedback
ProvideFeedback --> BlogsNewsUpdates: Await Response
PublishedArticles --> SearchArticles: Browse Articles
SearchArticles --> ReadArticle: Select Article
ReadArticle --> PublishedArticles: Finish Reading
LoginAttemptInvalid --> LoggedOut: Invalid Login Attempt
@enduml
